    method:"This model first scores each investment from historical price behavior, using the same market score for every risk level. It then groups investments by what they really expose you to, applies your chosen risk limits to the whole mix, and finally converts the safe percentages into money and units. It can leave cash rather than force an investment. Historical patterns can fail and future returns are never guaranteed.",
