    riskScale:"A safety multiplier from 0 to 1 applied when the proposed portfolio is too risky. 1 means no reduction was needed; 0.7 means the risky allocation was reduced to about 70% of its previous size.",
    portfolioVolTarget:"The maximum historical price-swing level the proposed portfolio is allowed to target for the selected risk setting. It is a safety ceiling, not a promised future volatility.",
